# Restaurant Revenue Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes restaurant business data to identify factors affecting revenue and customer demand. The objective is to understand restaurant performance, identify revenue-generating factors, and provide data-driven recommendations to increase revenue without expanding the restaurant.

## Business Problem

The restaurant wants to increase its revenue without opening new locations or significantly expanding its existing infrastructure.

The analysis focuses on understanding sales patterns, customer preferences, restaurant performance, and other business factors that can help improve revenue using existing resources.

## Objectives

- Analyze restaurant revenue and sales performance.
- Identify high-performing and low-performing categories.
- Understand customer and order patterns.
- Identify factors influencing revenue.
- Analyze restaurant performance using data.
- Provide actionable recommendations to increase revenue.
- Create visualizations and dashboards for business insights.

## Dataset

The project uses restaurant-related business data containing information about restaurant transactions, sales, customers, products/categories, and other relevant attributes.

The dataset was cleaned and prepared before performing exploratory data analysis.

