## Data Cleaning

The dataset was checked for:

- Missing values
- Duplicate records
- Incorrect data types
- Inconsistent values
- Outliers
- Invalid or unnecessary records

The cleaned dataset was then used for further analysis.

## Exploratory Data Analysis

The analysis includes:

- Revenue analysis
- Sales performance analysis
- Category-wise analysis
- Customer/order analysis
- Trend analysis
- Distribution analysis
- Correlation analysis
- Outlier analysis

## Key Insights

The analysis identifies:

- Important revenue-generating categories.
- High-performing restaurant segments.
- Areas with potential for revenue improvement.
- Customer and sales patterns.
- Opportunities to improve existing restaurant operations.

## Business Recommendations

Based on the analysis, recommendations are provided to increase revenue using existing resources rather than expanding the restaurant.

Possible strategies include:

- Promoting high-performing products.
- Improving sales of profitable categories.
- Using targeted offers during low-demand periods.
- Optimizing menu/product placement.
- Focusing on high-value customers.
- Improving operational efficiency.
- Using data-driven marketing campaigns.

## Dashboard

A Tableau dashboard was created to provide an interactive view of restaurant performance and revenue-related metrics.

The dashboard helps users monitor:

- Revenue
- Sales performance
- Product/category performance
- Customer trends
- Restaurant performance

